<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#17251f">
<title>حنان وسعد | حين أصبح المستحيل موعداً للعشق</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Cairo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--gold:#d8b66a;--gold2:#f0d99d;--ink:#24332c;--paper:#fffdf7;--muted:#6f786f;--scale:1}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:#17251f;color:var(--ink);font-family:"Cairo","Noto Naskh Arabic",Tahoma,sans-serif}
.hero{min-height:66vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:42px 18px;position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17251f,#344b3d 55%,#18251e);background-size:cover;background-position:center;color:#fff}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,20,15,.48),rgba(10,20,15,.78));z-index:-1}
.hero-inner{max-width:850px}
.eyebrow{color:var(--gold2);letter-spacing:3px;font-size:.85rem}
h1{font-family:"Amiri",serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,5.2rem);line-height:1.25;margin:18px 0 8px;color:#fff4d9;text-shadow:0 4px 22px #0008}
.subtitle{font-family:"Amiri",serif;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,2rem);color:#f2dfb4;margin:0 0 25px}
.hero p{color:#f5f1e8;line-height:2}
.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px}
button,.upload-label{border:1px solid #d8b66a;background:#d8b66a;color:#17251f;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:30px;font:600 .9rem "Cairo",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
button:hover,.upload-label:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#f0d99d}
button.secondary{background:#ffffff12;color:#fff;border-color:#ffffff80}
#photoInput{display:none}
main{max-width:1000px;margin:-34px auto 0;position:relative;padding:0 16px 60px}
.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#20352b;color:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b66a66;border-radius:18px;padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #0003}
.toolbar small{color:#d9d3c3}
.reader{margin-top:22px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 60px #0004}
.toc{padding:28px clamp(20px,5vw,55px);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5eedf,#fffdf7);border-bottom:1px solid #e6dcc5}
.toc h2,.chapter h2{font-family:"Amiri",serif;color:#72552a}
.toc h2{font-size:2rem;margin:0 0 14px}
.toc ol{columns:2;column-gap:35px;padding-right:24px;line-height:2.1}
.toc a{color:#526b59;text-decoration:none}
.toc a:hover{color:#9a702d;text-decoration:underline}
.chapter{padding:clamp(25px,5vw,55px);border-bottom:1px solid #eee6d7;scroll-margin-top:20px}
.chapter:last-child{border:0}
.chapter h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,5vw,2.35rem);margin:0 0 22px;line-height:1.5}
.chapter h2:after{content:"";display:block;width:75px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);margin-top:8px}
.chapter p{font-family:"Amiri",serif;font-size:calc(1.28rem * var(--scale));line-height:2.15;margin:0 0 16px;text-align:justify;color:#303a33}
.chapter .quote{margin:25px 0;padding:18px 22px;border-right:4px solid var(--gold);background:#f7f1e5;color:#6c542d;font-family:"Amiri",serif;font-size:calc(1.38rem * var(--scale));line-height:2}
.chapter .end{text-align:center;color:#9a702d;font-weight:bold;margin-top:28px}
.footer{text-align:center;color:#e7d9b8;padding:35px 15px 50px;font-family:"Amiri",serif;font-size:1.15rem}
.note{font-size:.83rem;color:#7b8079;line-height:1.8}
@media(max-width:600px){.toc ol{columns:1}.toolbar{justify-content:center}.toolbar small{width:100%;text-align:center}.chapter p{text-align:right}}
@media print{body{background:white}.hero{min-height:260px}main{margin:0;max-width:none}.toolbar,.actions{display:none}.reader{box-shadow:none}.chapter{break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero" id="hero">
 <div class="hero-inner">
  <div class="eyebrow">رواية رومانسية خيالية</div>
  <h1>حنان وسعد</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">حين أصبح المستحيل موعداً للعشق</div>
  <p>حكاية من الورود والرسائل والأسرار والمغامرات…<br>حيث تتحول الكلمات إلى عوالم، ويصبح الخيال رحلة لا تنتهي.</p>
  <div class="actions">
   <label class="upload-label" for="photoInput">✿ اختاري صورة حنان للخلفية</label>
   <input id="photoInput" type="file" accept="image/*">
   <button class="secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('book').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">ابدأ القراءة ↓</button>
   <button class="secondary" onclick="window.print()">طباعة / حفظ PDF</button>
  </div>
 </div>
</header>
